    "message": "Move test_household_correction.py under tests/unit/web\n\nOnly the file move, named after the module whose route it tests\n(web/workspace.py), so its history stays traceable. The next commit\nbuilds its drafts through the Project screen's preview instead of a\nseed-42 InitialScenarioBuilder draft (#88).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
